OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused 'said he killed his
OL,4,Acellmate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering his cellmate
OL,7,Ftold the victim "I'm worried I'm going
OL,8,Fto strangle you", a court heard.
OL,10,FNeil Ashby, 49, who was found dead at
OL,11,FHMP Stoke Heath, said he was worried
OL,12,Fabout Jonathan Alcide's mental health
OL,13,Fin the weeks before being allegedly
OL,14,Fstrangled to death by him on 30 June or
OL,15,F1 July 2025, Stafford Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FA prison officer described Alcide, 36,
OL,19,Fwho denied murder, as "eerily
OL,20,Fnonchalant" after he alerted staff
OL,21,FAshby was dead by ringing a buzzer and
OL,22,Fsaying "I've killed my padmate".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
