OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused 'said he killed his
OL,4,Acellmate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlcide accepted he killed Ashby by neck
OL,7,Fcompression, but asserted he was not
OL,8,Fguilty by reason of insanity and was
OL,9,Fguilty of manslaughter by diminished
OL,10,Fresponsibility, prosecutors said.
